('messageTemplates','r6cf02orm',$cs${"id": "r6cf02orm", "name": "NAR1 email (中文)", "body": "附上 {Company} 2026年度周年申報表相關文件，煩請閣下簽署並盡快寄回正本，謝謝配合！\n請列印單面\n1.\t2026年公司秘書費帳單\n2.\t表格 NAR1（請於第8頁簽署）\n3.\t唯一董事書面決議案（每頁請簽署）及 全體股東書面決議案（每頁請簽署）\n\n請閣下於上述文件指定位置簽署後，將所有正本文件最遲於2026年8月15日前寄回本公司，以便我們及時向公司註冊處提交。\n如有任何疑問，歡迎隨時聯絡本人。\n"}$cs$::jsonb),
('messageTemplates','rrv54bfes',$cs${"id": "rrv54bfes", "name": "NAR1  email (English)", "body": "Please find attached the relevant documents regarding {Company}'s 2026 Annual Return. Kindly print the documents single-sided, sign where indicated, and return the original copies to us at your earliest convenience.\n\nAction Required (Single-sided Printing):\n\n1. Invoice for 2026 Company Secretarial Fee\n\n2. Form NAR1: Please sign on Page 8.\n\n3. Written Resolution of Director & Written Resolution of Shareholder: Please sign every page of both resolutions.\n\nPlease sign the documents in the designated areas and return all original hard copies to our office no later than {Deadline} so we can submit them to the Companies Registry in a timely manner.\n\nShould you have any questions, please feel free to contact me."}$cs$::jsonb),
('messageTemplates','rxhcb9z22',$cs${"id": "rxhcb9z22", "name": "NAR1 whatsapp (中文)", "body": "附上 {Company} 2026年度周年申報表相關文件，煩請閣下簽署並盡快寄回正本，謝謝配合！\n\n請列印單面\n1.       2026年公司秘書費帳單\n2.       表格 NAR1（請於第8頁簽署）\n3.       董事書面決議案（每頁請簽署）及 股東書面決議案（每頁請簽署）\n\n請閣下於上述文件指定位置簽署後，將所有正本文件最遲於{Deadline}前寄回本公司，以便我們及時向公司註冊處提交。\n如有任何疑問，歡迎隨時聯絡本人。\""}$cs$::jsonb),
('messageTemplates','rq1cmn4mf',$cs${"id": "rq1cmn4mf", "name": "Filed NAR1 email (English)", "body": "Please be informed that the Annual Return (Form NAR1) for {Company} has been successfully filed with the Companies Registry.\n\nAttached please find the filed copy for your records and information.\n\nThank you, and please let us know if you require any further documents."}$cs$::jsonb),
('messageTemplates','r1u352p2c',$cs${"id": "r1u352p2c", "name": "Filed NAR1 email (中文)", "body": "{Company}的周年申報表（表格 NAR1）已成功向公司註冊處遞交。\n\n隨信附上已完成存檔的申報表副本，供閣下留存參照。\n\n如有任何查詢，歡迎隨時與我們聯絡，謝謝！"}$cs$::jsonb),
('messageTemplates','ro7temjtp',$cs${"id": "ro7temjtp", "name": "BVI Annual Return email  (English)", "body": "Regarding the filing of the 2025 Annual Return of {Company} on the Vistra portal, please find attached the Excel form for your completion. We have also attached the last year report for your reference.\n \nKindly fill in the required figures and return the completed form to us by {Deadline}. Once received, we will prepare and send you the final draft for the director’s signature.\n \nThank you for your cooperation, and please let us know if you have any questions."}$cs$::jsonb),
('messageTemplates','rmnlmemg9',$cs${"id": "rmnlmemg9", "name": "BVI Annual Return email (中文)", "body": "關於在 Vistra 平臺申報 2025 年度周年報表（Annual Return）一事，隨信附上 Excel 表格供您填寫。\n煩請填妥所需數據，並於{Deadline} 或之前，連同損益表及資產負債表(如有)一併發回給我們。\n收到相關資料後，我們將會準備最終草案並發送給您，以供董事簽署。\n感謝您的配合。如有任何疑問，歡迎隨時與我們聯絡。\n"}$cs$::jsonb),
('messageTemplates','rrlg54tgr',$cs${"id": "rrlg54tgr", "name": "ES Filing email (English)", "body": "Regarding the 2025 Economic Substance filing for {Company} on the Vistra portal, please find attached the PDF form for your completion.\n\nKindly fill in the required figures, sign the completed form, and return it to us by {Deadline}. Upon receipt, we will proceed to upload the document onto the portal accordingly.\n\nThank you for your cooperation. Please feel free to reach out if you have any questions or require assistance."}$cs$::jsonb),
('messageTemplates','rbhumoiny',$cs${"id": "rbhumoiny", "name": "ES Filing email (中文)", "body": "關於 {Company}於 Vistra 平台的 2025 年經濟實質（Economic Substance）申報事宜，隨信附上相關的 PDF 表格供閣下填寫。\n\n煩請於{Deadline}或之前填妥所需數據及簽署表格，並將已完成的表格電郵回覆給我們。收到後，我們將立即為閣下上載至平台進行申報。\n\n感謝閣下的配合。如有任何疑問，歡迎隨時與我們聯絡。"}$cs$::jsonb),
